            "review_title": "Review at Pasteur Street Brewing Co",
            "review_text": "M-p R\n2 contributions\n0\nExcellent beers and good company\nMay 2026 • Couples\nWe stopped in the middle of the day to beat the heat and have a beer. We had a beer flight that the bartender Duy Anh expertly chose for us, with the beers he thought we would enjoy based on our taste. It was really nice!! The beer was good, the food also. It was also fun to chat with Duy Anh while we were there. We recommend this place if you want to taste well balanced craft beers and enjoy some good food. Thank you some much Duy Anh, we will come back next time we are in Hanoi !!! 😌\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 16, 2026",
